OL,5,G2305 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FGrandmother Rose, who's 80, has
OL,7,     Ffluid on her lungs and is having
OL,8,     Ftrouble breathing, and 55-year-old
OL,9,     Ftrucker Kevin has serious injuries
OL,10,     Fafter his lorry rolled down a
OL,11,     Fverge.
OL,12,G0005 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,13,     FIn Oxfordshire, a motocross
OL,14,     Fcollision leaves 12-year-old Lewis
OL,15,     Fwith a broken thighbone. And
OL,16,     Fparaglider Lucasz is treated for
OL,17,     Fmultiple fractures after a crash
OL,18,     Fon the Cumbrian coast.
